# The build context is this directory. repo/ is a full git clone of the
# monorepo and secrets/ holds the Gitea deploy key (write access): neither may
# ever be sent to the Docker daemon or end up in an image layer. The Dockerfile
# only COPYs requirements.txt and app/.
repo/
secrets/
tests/
conftest.py
README.md
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
